{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“像有话”保留了比喻语气，没有写成他真的要找某人说话，也没有新增具体对象或对白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"熟悉感、过去不可复得和向前的冲动都停留在抽象心理层面，没有补造具体往事或把身体的冲动写成实际行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“撑住”和“垮下去”表达的是心理上的自我支撑，没有把珠子里的身体姿态写成真实动作，同时保留了投入与害怕失去之间的冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了寻找理由、接近确信又被舍不得拉回的心理过程，没有新增外部事件，也没有把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"从说不清的内在冲动，到熟悉感带来的前行牵引，再到害怕失去而强撑、寻找理由却反复退回，整体心理走向可以读懂。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“确信也变陌生”这一层没有明确保留；修补版写出了舍不得如何把他拉回来，却没有保留他对自身确信感到陌生的体验。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c679e36a-c24d-44c3-9e7e-127725943ae2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T051449793715Z", "elapsed_seconds": 257.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:19:07.199867+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "06aa25e7d6c21dd22defc7e5f137da4e6b2541ca2d996132865795161aa78738", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "prob